@startuml flujo-ssh-sftp
!theme plain
title Flujo de Conexion SSH (PTY) y Transferencia SFTP (Xftp)

actor Usuario
participant "Frontend\n(xterm.js + Xftp)" as UI
participant "SessionService\n& TransferService" as Svc
participant "SSH / SFTP\nAdapters" as Net
participant "Instancia EC2\n(Linux OpenSSH)" as EC2

== Conexion SSH + Verificacion TOFU ==
Usuario -> UI: Doble clic en instancia EC2
UI -> Svc: OpenSession(userID, hostID, cols, rows)
Svc -> Net: Connect(host, decryptedKey, tofuCallback)
Net -> EC2: Handshake SSH (:22)
EC2 --> Net: Host Public Key
Net -> Svc: Verificar huella en known_hosts (userID)
alt Host desconocido (TOFU)
  Svc --> UI: Solicitar confirmacion de huella SHA-256
  Usuario -> UI: Confirma confiar en el host
  UI -> Svc: TrustHostKey(...)
end
Net -> EC2: OpenPTY(xterm-256color) + Shell()
Net --> Svc: SessionHandle (stdin, stdout, resize)
Svc --> UI: sessionID activa

== Streaming Terminal ==
loop mientras sesion este activa
  Net -> EC2: Stdin / WindowChange
  EC2 --> Net: Stdout / Stderr ANSI
  Net --> UI: EventsEmit("terminal:data:<sessionID>")
end

== Transferencia SFTP ==
Usuario -> UI: Subir documento Windows -> EC2
UI -> Svc: UploadFile(sessionID, localPath, remotePath)
Svc -> Net: Stream chunks con context.Context
loop bloques 64KB
  Net -> EC2: SFTP Write Chunk
  Svc --> UI: EventsEmit("sftp:progress", bytes, total)
end
Svc --> UI: Transferencia completada

@enduml
